   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:wait",
    "edge:stand>wait",
    "focus:wait"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "站在路口，红灯亮了，要耐心地等一等："
    },
    {
     "en": "wait"
    },
    {
     "en": "Wait for me!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:look",
    "edge:action>look",
    "focus:look"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "下面是眼睛的动作。把眼睛转过去，专门去看："
    },
    {
     "en": "look"
    },
    {
     "en": "Look at me!"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "cue": [
    "show:see",
    "edge:look>see",
    "focus:see"
   ],
   "parts": [
    {
     "zh": "东西自己跑进了你的眼睛里，就是看见："
